{
  "slug": "claude-perfectionist",
  "name": "Claude Perfectionist",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Perfectionist audits your Claude Code instruction harness — CLAUDE.md, rules, hooks, settings, MCP config — and finds\n  contradictions, missing verification, stale commands, and context bloat you didn't know you had.\n\n  Key features:\n  - Verdict-first reports with adaptive templates (audit, bootstrap, contradiction debug)\n  - Evidence-grounded findings with honest confidence levels — no fake certainty\n  - Fix-first remediation — resolves contradictions before deleting anything\n  - Grades with human meaning (A — production-ready through F — actively misleading)\n  - Pure markdown, zero dependencies — works in Claude Code and Claude.ai",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `claude-perfectionist` (Activate when the user wants to edit, trim, audit, reorganize, or debug CLAUDE.md or any Claude Code config…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-perfectionist@claude-community` from `into-the-intraverse/claude-perfectionist`.",
